      "affected_surface": "Campaign-intake rejection precedence and coverage",
      "claim": "The plan places the blind-capability check after the existing final-panel qualification loop, so a blind-incompatible seat that is also unqualified can be rejected as final_panel_seat_unqualified instead of the rubric-required final_panel_seat_blind_incompatible. The planned fixtures cover qualified, override-admitted, and standing-pinned incompatible seats but do not cover this precedence case.",
